        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR TAIL IS YOUR AMMUNITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bulletail</strong> combines classic Snake gameplay with intense bullet-hell combat in a truly unique roguelike experience. Every shot costs precious tail length — eat bullets to grow stronger, but shoot too much and you’ll shrink!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snake Movement:</strong> Classic WASD controls — don’t hit yourself!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Ammo System:</strong> Your snake’s length IS your ammunition.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs Reward:</strong> Eat bullets to grow (+1 segment = +10 ammo), but shooting costs ammo (10 shots = −1 segment).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Damage:</strong> Each enemy hit removes more segments than the last.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Death:</strong> Run out of ammo OR hit yourself = immediate game over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Enemy Types:</strong> From Basics to Teleporters, Snipers, and Shield Carriers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> 3 legendary bosses every 10 waves.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Temporary Powerups:</strong> Speed Boost, Invincibility, Rapid Fire, Time Slow, Ghost Mode, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Permanent Upgrades:</strong> Damage, Fire Rate, Durability, Speed — choose 1 after each wave.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance aggressive combat with conservative ammo management. Early hits are recoverable, but consecutive hits become devastating. Choose upgrades to craft unique builds and dominate later waves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bulletail</strong> offers endless replayability through its one-of-a-kind ammo system. Can you master the balance between growth and survival to reach the highest waves?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR TAIL IS YOUR AMMUNITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bulletail</strong> combines classic Snake gameplay with intense bullet-hell combat in a truly unique roguelike experience. Every shot costs precious tail length — eat bullets to grow stronger, but shoot too much and you’ll shrink!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snake Movement:</strong> Classic WASD controls — don’t hit yourself!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Ammo System:</strong> Your snake’s length IS your ammunition.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs Reward:</strong> Eat bullets to grow (+1 segment = +10 ammo), but shooting costs ammo (10 shots = −1 segment).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Damage:</strong> Each enemy hit removes more segments than the last.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Death:</strong> Run out of ammo OR hit yourself = immediate game over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Enemy Types:</strong> From Basics to Teleporters, Snipers, and Shield Carriers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> 3 legendary bosses every 10 waves.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Temporary Powerups:</strong> Speed Boost, Invincibility, Rapid Fire, Time Slow, Ghost Mode, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Permanent Upgrades:</strong> Damage, Fire Rate, Durability, Speed — choose 1 after each wave.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance aggressive combat with conservative ammo management. Early hits are recoverable, but consecutive hits become devastating. Choose upgrades to craft unique builds and dominate later waves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bulletail</strong> offers endless replayability through its one-of-a-kind ammo system. Can you master the balance between growth and survival to reach the highest waves?</p>",
